    "id": "pose_23_seated_hand_on_ankle",
    "name": "Seated hand resting on ankle",
    "description": "Sitting on the floor with the right knee raised high and the left leg stretched forward heel down, the right hand reaching toward the right ankle (resting on the lower shin, the closest the rig's arm reach allows) while the left hand rests on the left hip crease. The torso turns slightly toward the raised leg and the head tilts right. Left/right are the character's own.",
    "targetModels": [
      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Single front-view line drawing used as reference; the knee is raised past the drawing so the hand reaches the lower shin, not the ankle bone, on this rig (fashion-sketch arms in the reference are longer).",
      "Buttocks and heels share floor contact; root height is the female/male mean within the 10 mm floor tolerance.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male reuses the same rotations with the hips-height-relative root offset."
    ],
    "generator": "scripts/pose_author/lib.py + /tmp/author_seated.py (poses-only scope; authoring script not committed)"
  },
